 viewpoint; talks about negative campaigning; responds to former President George Bush\u2019s statements about his son\u2019s {President Bush} decision to go to war in Iraq; comments on the same-sex marriage issue; talks about her daughters\u2019 appearance at the convention.] \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 210, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63870.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764417, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "WJfX52UjqF", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764411, "segment_id": "t3Ts1cDGmw", "segment_broadcast_id": "WJfX52UjqF", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (New York: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64080.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764418, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "WJfX52UjqF", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1720, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764411, "segment_id": "YCmgyWwof4", "segment_broadcast_id": "WJfX52UjqF", "segment_title": "(Commercial: ThermaCare; cholesterol PSA; Hyundai Sonata; Wal-Mart; Allegra; MSNBC.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64090.0", "legacy_seg